BIRXBFSk1QWE0xcFV0ZTlQdU92UWxqNU10Q1QyUGNqOFd4MkNKNE5hV0NfUDdMVEtFenRKdXR2RUM1ZksyazNIRDBDMW1ZelhsMjFxSkduR2ZYUDM0c2FxTTdaMURrRXVENGxGX3FkTFR5S0dMN0pydXh0dWRFQjhUOEJ5bW1Md2I1SDhiNEJ2V0tTS0RxLUY0UmR1bU0tVWY4bkQ1NmptbVVnQk1lOW9JcQ?oc=5","date":"2026-11-04","zh":"TrinityBridge Ltd 出售 85,091 股 Ameriprise Financial, Inc. 股票 $AMP"},{"title":"Under Pressure: Why Did ASX 200 Financial Stock AMP (ASX:AMP) Shares Slip?","src":"Kalkine Media","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQNlcteWtZU1JMUFltbjdnUjMzM2Z2aXB6MVd5cW1YWTFwZzlGTFJVOW40WjN1TDNXM2hqRnpWNEw2SXEteElGWW5TcHJYcHhJTEF4R21QRHcxTU5ZajRIcHlWYWRrM2Y1bTF4U0FuNzFmeWlYaDZUaldTQXVNR0J5dEs4Rkt2Z0xhTFFrWHI2NVNBdkNRLS1qQW5VU3NwRnUwWTQ0U1kya2pBV3FmSFZVdHdhbjk?oc=5","date":"2026-11-04","zh":"壓力之下：為何 ASX 200 金融股 AMP (ASX:AMP) 股價下跌？"}],"order_news":[],"themes":[{"name":"併購","count":2},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-19","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/820027/000082002726000011/amp-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Ameriprise Financial, Inc. is a diversified financial services company with a more than 130-year history of providing solutions to help clients confidently achieve their financial objectives. Ameriprise Financial, Inc. is a holding company incorporated in Delaware that primarily engages in business through its subsidiaries. Accordingly, references to \"Ameriprise,\" \"Ameriprise Financial,\" the \"Company,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" and \"our\" may refer to Ameriprise Financial, Inc. exclusively, to our entire family of companies, or to one or more of our subsidiaries.","zh":"Ameriprise Financial, Inc. 是一家多元化的金融服務公司，在提供解決方案幫助客戶自信地實現其財務目標方面擁有 130 多年的歷史。 Ameriprise Financial, Inc. 是一家在德拉瓦州註冊成立的控股公司，主要透過其子公司從事業務。因此，提及「Ameriprise」、「Ameriprise Financial」、「本公司」、「我們」、「我們」和「我們的」時，可能僅指 Ameriprise Financial, Inc.、我們的整個公司家族或我們的一個或多個子公司。"},{"en":"We are a long-standing leader in financial planning and advice offering a broad range of products and services designed to assist individual and institutional clients achieve their financial objectives. Our strategy is centered on helping clients confidently achieve their goals by providing holistic advice and by managing and protecting their assets and income. We carry out our strategy through two primary go-to-market approaches: Wealth Management and Asset Management.","zh":"我們是財務規劃和諮詢領域的長期領導者，提供廣泛的產品和服務，旨在幫助個人和機構客戶實現其財務目標。我們的策略重點是透過提供全面的建議以及管理和保護客戶的資產和收入，幫助客戶自信地實現其目標。我們透過兩種主要的市場進入方式來實施我們的策略：財富管理和資產管理。"},{"en":"Our wealth management business is the primary growth engine of Ameriprise with a significant market opportunity. We are in a compelling position to capitalize on significant long-term demographic and market trends driving increased demand for financial advice and solutions. In the United States (\"U.S.\"), the ongoing transition of baby boomers into retirement, as well as younger generations currently building their wealth and planning for retirement, continues to drive demand for financial advice and solutions. Our primary target market is households with $500,000 to $5,000,000 in investable assets. We are also well-suited to serve those outside this asset range as we also offer products and services designed for higher-net worth households.","zh":"我們的財富管理業務是Ameriprise的主要成長引擎，擁有龐大的市場機會。我們處於有利地位，可以利用重大的長期人口和市場趨勢，推動對財務建議和解決方案的需求不斷增加。在美國（「美國」），嬰兒潮世代正在向退休過渡，而年輕一代目前正在累積財富並規劃退休，繼續推動對財務建議和解決方案的需求。我們的主要目標市場是擁有 500,000 美元至 5,000,000 美元可投資資產的家庭。我們也非常適合為該資產範圍之外的人提供服務，因為我們還提供專為高淨值家庭設計的產品和服務。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Variable annuities that provide investment returns linked to underlying investment accounts of the contractholder's choice of certain funds, as well as additional benefits, such as guaranteed minimum death benefits (but without living benefits for new sales after mid-2022).","zh":"可變年金提供與合約持有人選擇的某些基金的基礎投資帳戶相關的投資回報，以及額外福利，例如保證最低死亡撫卹金（但不包括 2022 年中之後新銷售的生活福利）。"},{"en":"Structured variable annuities that use the performance of an underlying equity market index to determine earnings, subject to either a cap or floor.","zh":"結構性可變年金，利用基礎股票市場指數的表現來決定收益，受上限或下限限制。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We operate in a highly competitive global industry. As a diversified financial services firm, we compete directly with a variety of financial institutions, including registered investment advisers, securities brokers, asset managers, banks and insurance companies. We directly compete for the provision of products and services to clients, as well as for our financial advisors and investment management","zh":"我們在競爭激烈的全球產業中營運。作為一家多元化的金融服務公司，我們直接與各種金融機構競爭，包括註冊投資顧問、證券經紀人、資產管理公司、銀行和保險公司。我們直接競爭向客戶提供產品和服務，以及我們的財務顧問和投資管理"},{"en":"personnel. Certain of our competitors offer web-based or mobile-based financial services and discount brokerage services, usually with lower levels of service, to individual clients, and we increasingly compete with various financial technology companies.","zh":"人員。我們的某些競爭對手向個人客戶提供基於網路或行動裝置的金融服務和折扣經紀服務，通常服務水準較低，而且我們與各種金融科技公司的競爭日益激烈。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Advice & Wealth Management","val":12172000000,"zh":"建議與財富管理"},{"name":"Retirement & Protection Solutions","val":3955000000,"zh":"退休與保障解決方案"},{"name":"Asset Management","val":3621000000,"zh":"資產管理部門"}],"total":18911000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Investment Advice","val":11109000000,"zh":"投資建議"},{"name":"Investment Advice Advisory","val":6481000000,"zh":"投資建議諮詢"},{"name":"Distribution Service","val":3241000000,"zh":"配送服務"},{"name":"Investment Advice Retail Customer","val":2170000000,"zh":"Investment Advice Retail Customer"},{"name":"Distribution Service Insurance & Annuity","val":1538000000,"zh":"Distribution Service Insurance & Annuity"},{"name":"Distribution Service Mutual Funds","val":1117000000,"zh":"Distribution Service Mutual Funds"},{"name":"Investment Advice Institutional","val":671000000,"zh":"Investment Advice Institutional"},{"name":"Investment Advice Transaction & Other","val":660000000,"zh":"Investment Advice Transaction & Other"},{"name":"Investment Advice Financial Planning","val":496000000,"zh":"Investment Advice Financial Planning"},{"name":"Distribution Service Other Products","val":484000000,"zh":"Distribution Service Other Products"}],"total":18911000000}},"peers":["AIZ","AON","AVY","BEN","PFG"]}}